<article class="env-lemma" id="031Z">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/031Z">Lemma <span data-tag="031Z">10.158.6</span>.</a> Let $K/k$ be an extension of fields. Then $K$ is formally smooth over $k$ if and only if $H_1(L_{K/k}) = 0$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows from Proposition <a href="/tag/031J" data-tag="031J">10.138.8</a> and the fact that a vector spaces is free (hence projective). 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>